{"t": 1794119835.5496337, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "reports-api 502s \u2014 root cause found. Upstream ledger 2026.11 now includes `currency` on every row; reports/export.py's CSV writer only declared id,amount and raised `ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'`, failing every export. Fixed in reports/export.py by adding `currency` to the CSV schema (legacy rows without it export a blank cell). Needs a redeploy/restart of the reports-api ECS service to take effect. Evidence: CloudWatch /ecs/reports-api, eu-west-1."}, "ok": true}
